      "writtenOn": "2018-10-11T20:57:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "originally, we deprecate ACTION_SERVICE_STATE to use ServiceStateTable due to the background check restriction. However, it seems framework team don\u0027t like servicestateTable solution, so framework explicitly allow the ACTION_SERVICE_STATE to wakeup apps from background :( However, we still marked service state broadcast to be deprecated even though its still functional.\n\nFor my CL, I am adding this extra simply for the data roaming refactor. Given we still have this intent deprecated, I will just have this one marked hidden.\n\nFor the naming, I am following the rest of extras e.g,EXTRA_VOICE_ROAMING_TYPE, EXTRA_LTE_EARFCN_RSRP_BOOST. Do you think I should change this one or just keep it consistent with others? let me know",
